and inanimate subjects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >USE - interact with the object using a specific item in your inventory</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment and see what you can do!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130170/extras/ad2f38e3cc36ccd9eda792c64fb3f2df.poster.avif?t=1762810825\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130170/extras/ad2f38e3cc36ccd9eda792c64fb3f2df.webm?t=1762810825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130170/extras/ad2f38e3cc36ccd9eda792c64fb3f2df.mp4?t=1762810825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let the dark corners of the trees frighten you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you feel the eyes of a stranger on the back of your neck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player story mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your game and continue from where you left off</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fullscreen support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles, talk to animals, explore the forest, find your nut</p>","developers":["LoLoimu"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130170/1edff4c1ecc57c8f2c30c3f918cc2264a1a39e11/header.jpg?t=1762810825","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4130170/1075040964/ff91a6aae58f09f82c2bb5b8ea48ce83195d4ad7/1761493512/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762807